WEBVTT

00:01.300 --> 00:07.430
Dear Mother, when you fell in love with father, did you ever become lost and worried?

00:08.540 --> 00:12.680
I've thought about it a great deal and found out who I truly love.

00:13.990 --> 00:15.150
The one I chose is...

00:15.920 --> 00:16.710
Francis.

00:26.710 --> 00:27.870
NAAJA

00:26.710 --> 00:27.870
Nadja

00:27.900 --> 00:30.370
kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:27.920 --> 00:30.370
With your eyes

00:30.370 --> 00:31.530
NAAJA

00:30.420 --> 00:31.530
Nadja

00:31.550 --> 00:33.800
nani ga mieru

00:31.550 --> 00:33.800
What do you see?

00:34.020 --> 00:36.910
haruka tooku hikaru

00:34.020 --> 00:36.910
Shining in the far distance,

00:37.060 --> 00:39.200
mirai no tobira

00:37.060 --> 00:39.200
The door to the future,

00:40.340 --> 00:43.750
sagashiteiru

00:40.340 --> 00:43.750
That's what I'm searching for

00:43.750 --> 00:50.960
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:51.670 --> 00:55.080
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:55.180 --> 00:58.440
arasoimo kitto nakunaru

00:55.180 --> 00:58.440
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:58.510 --> 01:01.890
kon nani mo tanoshiku naru

00:58.540 --> 01:01.890
It could be so much more fun

01:01.920 --> 01:05.370
sekai wa hiruikedo hitotsune

01:01.920 --> 01:05.370
The world is wide, but it's still one

01:05.740 --> 01:09.100
tabi no owari wa mienai

01:05.740 --> 01:09.100
I can't see the end of the journey

01:09.130 --> 01:12.290
kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:09.130 --> 01:12.290
God is the only one who can possibly know

01:12.460 --> 01:16.110
itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:12.460 --> 01:16.110
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:16.110 --> 01:18.260
te wo furinagara

01:16.110 --> 01:18.260
I will go waving

01:18.410 --> 01:25.150
toki ni wa BURUU ni naru himo aru kedo

01:18.410 --> 01:25.150
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:25.150 --> 01:27.890
ushiro mukanai

01:25.150 --> 01:27.890
But I won't look back

01:28.160 --> 01:33.200
yume ga kanau hima de

01:28.160 --> 01:33.200
Until the day my dream comes true

01:33.370 --> 01:36.750
NAAJA kimi no hoho emi wa

01:33.370 --> 01:36.750
Nadja, your smile

01:36.830 --> 01:40.030
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:36.830 --> 01:40.030
Nadja, you give me courage

01:40.330 --> 01:43.290
aoi sora no shita de

01:40.330 --> 01:43.290
Under the blue sky

01:43.270 --> 01:46.080
ashita no yukue

01:43.270 --> 01:46.080
I will find the place

01:46.600 --> 01:50.230
mitsu kerukara

01:46.600 --> 01:50.230
Where my future lies

02:05.840 --> 02:08.430
For Lord Francis to enjoy himself so much...

02:08.530 --> 02:09.510
It's mortifying.

02:09.640 --> 02:11.340
They are completely in harmony.

02:11.880 --> 02:13.340
Who is his partner?

02:31.930 --> 02:35.510
That child...isn't she the dancer from the Dandelion Troupe?

02:35.830 --> 02:36.970
You know her?

02:37.530 --> 02:40.300
He danced with her once before.

02:40.970 --> 02:42.150
Francis has...

02:47.410 --> 02:48.100
Lady Emma.

02:48.690 --> 02:51.580
Please publicly announce the matter we have been discussing.

02:52.050 --> 02:54.490
Does that mean he has acccepted?

03:04.050 --> 03:05.900
Francis, I...

03:06.340 --> 03:08.440
I have wanted to dance with you.

03:08.740 --> 03:09.410
Thank you.

03:09.920 --> 03:11.600
Francis, come with me a moment.

03:12.170 --> 03:13.800
Father, let me introduce her to you.

03:14.070 --> 03:14.570
This is--

03:14.590 --> 03:15.580
Hurry and come.

03:16.220 --> 03:17.010
Father!

03:19.550 --> 03:20.100
Sorry.

03:22.710 --> 03:27.720
Everyone, thank you very much for coming to our party at Harcourt tonight.

03:28.320 --> 03:31.770
I would like to take this opportunity to make an announcement.

03:38.240 --> 03:44.360
I would like to announce that my son Francis is engaged to Miss Mary Ann from the Hamilton family.

03:49.820 --> 03:50.780
Francis is...

03:51.370 --> 03:52.210
Engaged?

03:58.770 --> 04:03.100
Three Person Triangle. The Reeling, Loving Heart.

04:04.430 --> 04:06.730
Father! What is the meaning of this?

04:07.050 --> 04:09.490
This is the first I've heard of any engagement.

04:09.940 --> 04:11.440
It's for the sake of the Harcourt family.

04:14.260 --> 04:17.070
If things keep going on like they are now, the House of Harcourt will decline.

04:17.520 --> 04:17.990
Huh?

04:18.850 --> 04:22.260
After the last business venture failed, our circumstances have deteriorated.

04:22.700 --> 04:26.450
If we don't get assistance from the Hamilton House, this House will go under.

04:28.650 --> 04:32.260
It would mean losing this mansion and all of our assets.

04:34.180 --> 04:35.960
This problem doesn't concern only you.

04:36.550 --> 04:40.530
This important engagement has the Harcourt House hanging on the line.

04:40.820 --> 04:41.740
Even if you say so...!

04:41.780 --> 04:46.820
If you refuse, we won't be able to fund the orphanages and hospitals that you take care of.

04:47.980 --> 04:50.670
It will trouble a lot of people.

05:08.450 --> 05:09.900
Francis is engaged...

05:10.740 --> 05:11.480
This can't be...!

05:17.460 --> 05:19.060
It's a pity, isn't it?

05:19.660 --> 05:22.220
You have been after Lord Francis, haven't you?

05:22.990 --> 05:24.220
Give it up.

05:24.570 --> 05:26.370
You are no match for Mary Ann.

05:26.690 --> 05:29.750
She is the daughter of the Hamilton House, after all.

05:29.950 --> 05:32.200
What House are you from?

05:32.690 --> 05:36.810
Well, since we don't know you, it can't be a very important family.

05:38.490 --> 05:40.170
I'm not a noble.

05:40.490 --> 05:42.860
I am a dancer from the Dandelion Troupe.

05:43.210 --> 05:45.800
What is a dancer doing at a party for the nobility?

05:47.450 --> 05:48.910
I came with Francis.

05:49.530 --> 05:50.890
"Francis," you say?

05:51.060 --> 05:53.820
Just calling him "Francis," aren't you being overly familiar with him?

05:54.000 --> 05:54.840
I understand.

05:55.400 --> 05:57.770
You have been deceiving Lord Francis, haven't you?

05:58.390 --> 05:59.280
No, I have not!

06:00.510 --> 06:01.280
Francis.

06:02.270 --> 06:03.330
Francis!

06:04.320 --> 06:08.780
Francis, you have understood your position and are a splendid noble.

06:09.180 --> 06:14.510
I hardy think that the successor to the Harcourt family would choose a dancer as his partner, right?

06:15.870 --> 06:16.830
Francis!

06:26.830 --> 06:29.840
Someone please expel this child!

06:31.890 --> 06:32.880
What are you doing?

06:33.150 --> 06:33.770
Nadja!

06:36.800 --> 06:40.560
Is there no one who will remove this girl?

06:40.630 --> 06:41.620
What is the meaning of this?

06:42.010 --> 06:43.400
Even though I brought her here.

06:43.820 --> 06:47.540
Lord Francis, this girl is a dancer from a wandering performance group.

06:47.740 --> 06:49.320
And what if she is?

06:50.880 --> 06:52.110
She is herself.

06:52.480 --> 06:55.710
Her lineage has nothing to do with her worth as a human.

06:56.730 --> 06:57.620
Francis.

06:58.310 --> 07:00.600
Lord Francis, you mustn't be fooled!

07:00.700 --> 07:02.480
Just what did she do?

07:02.750 --> 07:06.060
You approached him because of his assets, didn't you? What a greedy child!

07:06.260 --> 07:07.840
Who is the greedy one?

07:10.180 --> 07:13.050
I have learned a great deal from her.

07:13.980 --> 07:17.710
That helping people isn't just about giving them money.

07:18.180 --> 07:21.760
That you can make people happy with dances and smiles.

07:22.700 --> 07:25.270
The beauty of her heart has nothing to do with what House she is from.

07:26.180 --> 07:28.870
To only judge a person based on their social status and assets...

07:29.290 --> 07:30.520
I think it's a sad thing.

07:34.570 --> 07:35.560
Nadja, let's go.

07:45.020 --> 07:45.680
Francis.

07:46.320 --> 07:47.340
Hey, Francis.

07:49.530 --> 07:52.150
Nadja, please trust me.

07:53.530 --> 07:55.780
I will definitely protect you.

08:02.740 --> 08:03.380
Who is it?

08:04.770 --> 08:05.600
Francis.

08:08.760 --> 08:09.410
Father.

08:09.780 --> 08:10.440
Aunt Emma.

08:10.940 --> 08:11.950
I am terribly sorry.

08:12.470 --> 08:14.340
I will not become engaged to Mary Ann.

08:14.670 --> 08:15.330
Francis!

08:18.520 --> 08:21.430
Mary Ann, you are an important person to me.

08:22.050 --> 08:23.380
An important childhood friend.

08:24.340 --> 08:28.000
But I will be the one to decide who I marry.

08:28.170 --> 08:30.370
I won't allow it! I won't allow such a thing!

08:30.610 --> 08:33.500
That's right. This is a serious matter for the Harcourt family.

08:33.750 --> 08:36.490
This is not the time to be infatuated with a dancer girl.

08:36.740 --> 08:38.440
It's true that Nadja is a dancer.

08:38.960 --> 08:41.550
But her parentage or assets don't matter.

08:42.410 --> 08:44.040
I have fallen in love with her.

08:47.450 --> 08:50.440
Nadja has learned that her mother is alive.

08:50.710 --> 08:52.040
She wishes to see her.

08:52.660 --> 08:55.230
Therefore, we will go to Vienna.

08:55.500 --> 08:56.120
Vienna?

08:57.600 --> 09:03.130
We know that Nadja's mother originates from the Preminger Dukedom.

09:04.340 --> 09:06.240
Preminger Dukedom?

09:06.310 --> 09:08.630
Preminger, you say? That's Vienna's...

09:09.130 --> 09:12.610
That dancer has a relation to the Preminger Dukedom?

09:13.030 --> 09:14.190
Is this true?

09:14.480 --> 09:15.870
Yes, it's true.

09:16.210 --> 09:21.220
Now that you mention it, the newspapers said that Duke Preminger had a granddaughter.

09:21.400 --> 09:23.910
It has become a big subject in society.

09:24.230 --> 09:25.490
The newspapers...

09:25.840 --> 09:26.310
Yes.

09:27.050 --> 09:29.520
In fact, the granddaughter's name is Nadja.

09:30.280 --> 09:33.760
But the article also said that she was in Vienna.

09:34.530 --> 09:36.750
You're a fake Nadja, aren't you?

09:37.320 --> 09:38.870
I am the real Nadja.

09:39.520 --> 09:41.390
The one in Vienna is a fake!

09:43.790 --> 09:48.260
To prove this, I will go to Vienna with Nadja.

10:02.850 --> 10:05.390
Very well. Go to Vienna.

10:05.910 --> 10:06.600
Uncle...

10:07.190 --> 10:09.660
This is a grave affair for high society.

10:10.330 --> 10:13.040
I will contact Duke Preminger.

10:13.680 --> 10:17.020
If we contact him beforehand, things will go smoothly.

10:17.950 --> 10:19.070
I'm counting on you.

10:19.680 --> 10:21.260
Thank you, Aunt Emma.

10:22.030 --> 10:23.780
Tomorrow, we depart early.

10:24.320 --> 10:24.770
Alright.

10:43.060 --> 10:47.550
Preminger is the most noted family among the most noted families.

10:47.950 --> 10:51.920
If the Harcourt family and the Preminger family became closer...

10:52.070 --> 10:53.580
Brother, calm down.

10:54.020 --> 10:58.990
We don't know whether this girl is the real granddaughter of Duke Preminger.

10:59.280 --> 11:00.490
That's right.

11:02.000 --> 11:05.280
It will be a terrible thing if she's a fake.

11:06.890 --> 11:11.870
If the only successor to the Harcourt family makes a mishap and becomes close to the dancer...

11:17.180 --> 11:20.930
I will also go to ascertain whether she is real or not.

11:22.590 --> 11:23.700
Please do not worry.

11:24.360 --> 11:31.550
If she really is the granddaughter of Duke Preminger, I will give up the engagement with Francis.

12:08.460 --> 12:10.160
Ah! We've arrived!

12:10.510 --> 12:11.320
Come, Na--

12:11.320 --> 12:12.780
We're here!

12:15.520 --> 12:16.830
Oh no, I'm sorry.

12:17.150 --> 12:18.410
I'll do it again properly.

12:18.710 --> 12:20.580
No, since you're already out.

12:20.850 --> 12:21.450
But...

12:21.790 --> 12:23.450
Let's go, young lady.

12:24.190 --> 12:24.630
Yes!

12:25.030 --> 12:27.940
Good morning Nadja, Francis.

12:28.630 --> 12:30.410
Mary Ann, what are you doing here?

12:30.580 --> 12:35.690
Your father and aunt Emma said they would be at ease if I accompanied you.

12:36.730 --> 12:40.780
I have spoken with Duke Preminger many times at parties.

12:41.420 --> 12:43.490
You've never spoken with him before, have you, Francis?

12:43.840 --> 12:44.380
No...

12:45.860 --> 12:48.260
I will also help you, Nadja.

12:48.970 --> 12:50.210
Thank you very much.

12:56.480 --> 13:01.860
The article I saw says that the Black Rose stole the brooch from the Nadja in Vienna.

13:02.330 --> 13:03.860
The Black Rose...

13:04.230 --> 13:05.610
For Nadja's sake, Keith has...

13:06.150 --> 13:10.380
Therefore, vindicating your innocence with just the brooch will prove difficult.

13:10.850 --> 13:12.990
Do you not have any other proof?

13:13.410 --> 13:13.930
I do.

13:18.770 --> 13:20.470
Mother's diary and music box.

13:20.790 --> 13:24.320
And Mother's dress, although it has been altered.

13:26.150 --> 13:26.890
That is...

13:30.350 --> 13:31.390
A kaleidoscope, isn't it?

13:31.830 --> 13:32.870
I recognize it.

13:33.340 --> 13:34.820
Perhaps Keith?

13:35.410 --> 13:35.850
Yes.

13:36.320 --> 13:37.060
So that's it.

13:37.580 --> 13:38.840
You got it from Keith.

13:39.580 --> 13:40.740
I can't believe it.

13:41.140 --> 13:44.070
That Keith would give his Mother's memento to someone.

13:44.790 --> 13:49.800
When we were children, he wouldn't let me touch it no matter how many times I asked.

13:51.010 --> 13:52.300
Isn't that right, Francis?

13:52.940 --> 13:53.310
Right...

13:54.300 --> 13:55.430
So that's how it was...

13:55.880 --> 13:58.810
You're carrying around something very precious, aren't you?

13:59.550 --> 14:00.960
I forgot to give it back to him.

14:01.450 --> 14:02.200
What should I do?

14:08.810 --> 14:11.430
Keith...wasn't he an eyesore?

14:12.560 --> 14:15.210
Even long ago, Keith was a person who troubled others.

14:15.670 --> 14:17.210
Hasn't he been trouble to you?

14:17.580 --> 14:18.420
Such a thing...

14:19.300 --> 14:23.720
Ever since he was a child, he never cared if he was bothering others.

14:24.120 --> 14:26.930
Only thinking about himself and being selfish, with a cold heart...

14:27.110 --> 14:28.020
That's not true!

14:30.290 --> 14:31.430
You're exaggerating.

14:32.070 --> 14:34.290
He has his selfish and rude moments...

14:34.980 --> 14:37.350
But Keith is a gentle person from the bottom of his heart!

14:38.560 --> 14:41.450
He has always helped people who were troubled.

14:41.740 --> 14:45.000
He also supported me and greatly helped me out.

14:45.400 --> 14:46.040
I see.

14:46.290 --> 14:49.030
You've been saved by Keith...

14:51.370 --> 14:52.340
I apologize.

14:52.850 --> 14:56.240
It's natural to get angry when someone important to you gets badmouthed.

14:56.530 --> 14:57.890
I'm sorry, Nadja.

14:58.240 --> 14:59.320
I-it's alright.

15:05.940 --> 15:07.790
Keith is a gentle person from the bottom of his heart.

15:08.510 --> 15:11.620
He also supported me and greatly helped me out.

15:12.600 --> 15:13.100
Nadja...

15:13.670 --> 15:15.100
To you, Keith is...

15:19.000 --> 15:20.870
It would be great if we can find your mother quickly.

15:21.200 --> 15:21.640
Yes.

15:22.110 --> 15:24.680
Just thinking about my mother makes me happy.

15:25.150 --> 15:27.860
Because meeting her is my greatest dream.

15:28.280 --> 15:29.340
Your greatest dream?

15:29.590 --> 15:30.080
Yes.

15:30.310 --> 15:33.470
The reason I joined the traveling performance troupe was so I could find my mother.

15:33.960 --> 15:36.160
I've also liked dancing since I was a child.

15:36.630 --> 15:38.670
It was really great that I became a dancer.

15:39.090 --> 15:39.560
I see.

15:40.030 --> 15:40.870
Now that you mention it...

15:41.910 --> 15:44.900
Your dance with Francis was quite splendid.

15:45.170 --> 15:46.230
Do you mean it?

15:46.450 --> 15:51.610
It made me happy when the customers could enjoy themselves because of my dancing.

15:52.230 --> 15:54.670
Thank goodness you understand me.

15:55.290 --> 15:57.340
Did you enjoy your life in the troupe?

15:57.580 --> 15:58.720
Yes, very!

15:58.920 --> 16:01.930
The people in the troupe were all interesting and kindhearted, after all.

16:02.200 --> 16:02.670
Really.

16:03.460 --> 16:05.730
So, exactly what do you like about Francis?

16:07.040 --> 16:07.950
What, you ask...

16:10.350 --> 16:11.510
His kindness.

16:12.080 --> 16:12.890
Kindness?

16:13.530 --> 16:15.750
That's the same reason you like Keith, isn't it?

16:22.940 --> 16:23.750
Francis...

16:24.250 --> 16:24.790
Keith...

16:25.610 --> 16:27.580
The kindness from them is somehow different.

16:28.470 --> 16:29.580
What is it...?

16:30.470 --> 16:31.650
You don't have to worry.

16:32.070 --> 16:32.390
Huh?

16:32.690 --> 16:34.440
We'll surely find your mother.

16:36.270 --> 16:38.490
Isn't that what you were thinking about?

16:38.960 --> 16:40.270
Ah, yes, of course.

16:40.590 --> 16:43.030
I would be frightened if I were alone.

16:43.450 --> 16:44.690
But I'm with you, Francis.

16:47.180 --> 16:48.000
It's Keith, right?

16:49.800 --> 16:50.470
Keith...

16:51.280 --> 16:53.300
Was the one who got your brooch back?

16:54.140 --> 16:54.560
Yeah.

16:56.880 --> 16:57.450
I see.

17:16.290 --> 17:17.750
Shall we have some tea?

17:18.040 --> 17:19.100
I will go fetch it.

17:19.600 --> 17:20.830
Oh, if it's just that...

17:20.830 --> 17:21.770
I'll be fine by myself.

17:22.040 --> 17:22.930
I'll be back!

17:24.560 --> 17:27.500
It would have been enough to call the train crew to fetch the drinks.

17:27.720 --> 17:28.810
She hasn't grown accustomed to this, has she?

17:29.180 --> 17:30.780
It's one of her strong points.

17:31.150 --> 17:32.880
She walks a lot and smiles a lot.

17:34.160 --> 17:35.000
She is in high spirits.

17:35.520 --> 17:37.050
That's right, she's an adorable girl.

17:37.590 --> 17:38.950
An innocent child.

17:39.570 --> 17:41.030
She likes the kind you.

17:41.420 --> 17:42.900
And the kind Keith.

17:43.570 --> 17:46.530
She can't distinguish which feelings are true.

17:47.940 --> 17:49.990
You must have noticed it, right?

17:50.280 --> 17:51.320
Her feelings.

17:52.730 --> 17:54.950
That you don't come first.

17:55.910 --> 17:57.150
Don't you think it's enough?

17:57.810 --> 18:01.490
Let's finish this job after we bring her to the Preminger Dukedom.

18:01.960 --> 18:02.600
Job?

18:03.150 --> 18:04.700
It's because of Nobless Oblige, right?

18:05.290 --> 18:07.070
You must help people in trouble.

18:07.590 --> 18:09.560
That is why you lend her a hand.

18:10.330 --> 18:11.290
That's all, isn't it?

18:11.560 --> 18:14.700
You're wrong! Nobless Oblige has nothing to do with it! I...

18:16.670 --> 18:18.600
I truly love Nadja.

18:25.540 --> 18:26.650
I understand.

18:26.890 --> 18:30.280
Tea for three people. I will bring it to your room.

18:30.500 --> 18:32.770
Since I already came this far, I can bring it.

18:33.170 --> 18:35.460
No, it is my job.

18:44.790 --> 18:46.180
I love Nadja.

18:47.020 --> 18:49.090
But...The one Nadja really likes is...

18:53.040 --> 18:55.430
The one she really loves...

19:03.930 --> 19:05.600
It seems they will be brining some tea.

19:06.370 --> 19:07.600
I know that.

19:10.940 --> 19:11.830
I won't give up.

19:14.000 --> 19:17.310
Even if you really are the granddaughter of Duke Preminger...

19:17.800 --> 19:19.450
I won't give up Francis.

19:19.950 --> 19:23.130
Handing him over or not, Francis is not an object!

19:23.430 --> 19:27.210
You have many precious people besides Francis, right?

19:27.650 --> 19:30.220
Your mother, your dancing, your troupe...

19:30.760 --> 19:31.800
And Keith!

19:34.710 --> 19:35.380
As for me...

19:36.240 --> 19:36.790
As for me...

19:37.900 --> 19:38.790
I only have Francis.

19:45.060 --> 19:49.620
Vienna

19:50.020 --> 19:51.470
The real Lady Nadja?

19:51.870 --> 19:53.620
Yes, this is the proof.

19:53.920 --> 19:55.870
Please look at her chest closely.

19:57.000 --> 19:58.490
T...this brooch is...

19:58.680 --> 20:02.510
This photograph of her was taken in Venice with a person named Carlo.

20:02.780 --> 20:06.410
And this is an article about Carlo being arrested.

20:06.680 --> 20:10.580
In short, this photo was taken before Carlo got arrested.

20:10.950 --> 20:11.920
Therefore...

20:12.430 --> 20:16.040
This is proof that the brooch was hers long before.

20:16.480 --> 20:19.300
So she is really the true Nadja Preminger.

20:19.570 --> 20:22.530
Please inform Duke Preminger about this without wasting another minute.

20:22.830 --> 20:24.160
Well, that is...

20:24.510 --> 20:26.160
A very interesting conversation.

20:26.630 --> 20:27.390
Lord Duke!

20:27.520 --> 20:28.950
Ah...! Pleased to meet you.

20:29.300 --> 20:32.550
Duke Preminger, I am Montmartre Journal's...

20:32.900 --> 20:35.590
I'm sorry, but I already overheard your conversation.

20:36.330 --> 20:41.220
You say that the Nadja here is fake and the real one is in this photograph?

20:41.710 --> 20:42.330
That's right.

20:42.680 --> 20:46.130
Her brooch was stolen in Egypt by two thieves.

20:46.400 --> 20:48.800
Their names are Rosso and Bianco.

20:49.690 --> 20:50.380
And then?

20:50.750 --> 20:56.920
The brooch was handed over to Herman of this House and then went to the girl who calls herself Nadja.

20:57.290 --> 20:59.340
Please investigate this matter.

21:00.400 --> 21:02.480
May I have this photograph?

21:02.870 --> 21:05.140
Y-yes, of course! Please do!

21:05.660 --> 21:09.260
The Nadja I know has been traveling to find her mother.

21:09.590 --> 21:11.960
Please let Nadja meet her. Please, I'm counting on you!

21:13.560 --> 21:16.820
Contact Rosso and Bianco and bring them to me.

21:17.120 --> 21:19.630
Are you trusting this reporter's article?

21:20.740 --> 21:23.710
I wouldn't trust a reporter from a newspaper, would I?

21:24.550 --> 21:25.290
Then why?

21:25.680 --> 21:29.110
I have received a call from the Harcourt family of England.

21:29.580 --> 21:32.450
The son of the Harcourt House is coming here, it seems.

21:32.920 --> 21:35.090
With the girl who calls herself Nadja.

21:36.000 --> 21:39.680
What I trust is what I judge with my own eyes.

21:40.050 --> 21:43.900
I will ascertain which one of them is the real Nadja.

21:47.680 --> 21:48.860
Nadja is coming...

21:49.830 --> 21:51.260
You're bad at giving up, aren't you?

21:53.130 --> 21:53.750
Fine then.

21:54.270 --> 21:55.600
If you are coming, then come.

